Package: iso-codes
Version: @DEB_ISO-CODES_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://salsa.debian.org/iso-codes-team/iso-codes
Description: ISO code lists and translation tables
 Lists of country, language, currency and script names with translations,
 plus the iso-codes.pc pkg-config file. Data only; required by gnome-desktop.
